Just gonna.. play on fast... I still don't understand why we dug that gigantic hole for this building

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.740
I feel like I'm also not playing the game, right?

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:26.800
Because I probably hired way too many workers. And I probably haven't been tossing them around efficiently between

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:33.620
machines, I haven't been buying the right machines, but I've still got 14 million euros. And if I am playing it wrong

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:36.180
then you would have to play this a lot more slowly

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.420
because you wouldn't have as many workers working on your skyscraper,

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.740
And therefore it would take longer.

00:15:43.780 --> 00:15:45.020
*nods of uncertainty*

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:48.640
There's nothing else for me to do at this point, I'm literally just sitting around

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:51.799
I mean, I want to see it done. I want to see it done

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:55.180
I'm hoping that there's gonna be some kind of a satisfaction out of it.

00:15:55.860 --> 00:16:00.740
I mean, maybe you could multitask and do other projects at once but I don't think I have the money for it, I guess...

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:08.820
And we're really moving fast now and that's good. This is the most direct equivalent to watching paint dry

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:14.109
I've ever seen in a game and I'm not trying to say that, like I'm not coming at this game trying to be insulting about it.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:17.020
I mean look at what paint drying is

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:23.560
you look at a wall and you wait and watch as minute changes happen over a long period of time.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.460
And compare that to what I'm doing in this game.

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:27.800
Done

00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:33.780
It took two years, 17 weeks and 16 hours.

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:37.160
*deep breath*

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:38.160
Alright.

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.070
What now?

00:16:40.070 --> 00:16:43.840
So there's no management system of.. rent or?

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:46.180
Ah there.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.190
It's just plus or minus again...

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:49.600
Soo...

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:50.700
Wha-..

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:51.700
Da...?

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:55.340
This...

00:16:57.100 --> 00:17:04.500
Am I making money?? and- I'm- I did- I'm- I am. I made money... okay?

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:08.360
So I guess the next thing to do would be to....

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.800
Build another one.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.000
Oh..

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:21.800
But that's too expensive.. I can't, I don't have enough money..

00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:24.140
I have to wait until I get money.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.100
huh..

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.440
Okay, Alright I think I'm good. I think-

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:31.500
I think- I think I'm good.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:32.420
Leader board?!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:35.120
No one's on the leader board. Okay?

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:37.680
I'm good.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.040
I'm real good.

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:45.780
So that was, arguably the worst game on Steam and I say that not from

00:17:46.220 --> 00:17:53.079
broken controls, because oddly enough the controls worked. Not from glitchy gameplay, because at the end of it-

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:58.540
I did build a skyscraper and I guess it was a simulation of what it's like to be a skyscraper

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:06.520
But at the same time it wasn't fun. It wasn't a happy time. I had no idea why I was even there...

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:07.480
And...

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:08.540
frankly...

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:15.259
I'm sad that I wasted my life trying to figure out why they dug that big of a hole for that small of a skyscraper

00:18:15.269 --> 00:18:17.009
but either way that is

00:18:17.009 --> 00:18:18.720
the worst game that I found on Steam.

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:24.139
I'm sure that I'll find another, because I'm sure that you guys know about worse games on Steam.

00:18:24.139 --> 00:18:28.309
So if you know of a game that's worse than this one, Let me know down in the comments below.

00:18:28.309 --> 00:18:32.059
I will go through the process of reviewing it myself and I will show you.

00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:34.900
How probably right you are. *Outro music starts to play silently*

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:40.580
So thank you everybody so much for watching. And as always I will see you in the next video.

